Description: HSCL1 base files: CLI, release marker and Midnight wallpaper
 HSCL1 is a Linux workstation built on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS and KDE Plasma.
 Made with love by hcsmedia.
 .
 This package ships the hscl command line tool, /etc/hscl-release and the
 original HSCL1 Midnight wallpaper. It is not endorsed by Canonical, the
 Kali project or the Tails project.
